{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1071860-april-fools-list","id":1071860,"title":"April fools list???","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-01T18:39:40-07:00","id":1071860,"title":"April fools list???","content":"Does anyone have a list of all the April Fools jokes from the first to the current for published books that OP/WW have written?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-01T21:20:12-07:00","id":1071896,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>2004: Justin Achilli puts up a <a href=\"http://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/whitewolf/images/8/8b/Nads.pdf/revision/latest?cb=20170402040816\" target=\"_blank\">preview</a> of a game he may or may not be working on titled &quot;Nads.&quot;</li> <li>2008: Developer Bax Masterson releases a sample of <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/62512?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">World of Darkness: Shadows of Iceland</a> for Chronicles of Darkness. Other developers are publicly furious at him for releasing the document. Several days later, although he's posted on the WW blog for months by this point and has his name in the credits of several books, Bax is revealed to be a fiction created by WW's other developers.</li> <li>2009: ExXxalted: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/60995?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">Scroll of Swallowed Darkness</a> released.</li> <li>2010: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/80218?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">World of Darkness: Dudes of Legend</a> for Chronicles of Darkness released.</li> <li>2011: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrufiction.com/product/89938?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">Paths of Storytelling: Vampire</a> (the first new VTM book since 2004) released.</li> <li>2013: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/112967?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">Scion Extras: Supplemental (Yet Can Still Be Useful On Occasion) Scions</a></li> <li>2014: Chronicles of Darkness: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrucards.com/product/127718?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">Overly Specific Condition Cards</a></li> <li>2015: Chronicles of Darkness: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/146959?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">Gothic Icons</a></li> <li>2017: <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/208683?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Frost Giant Butt Warriors</a></li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}